WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:04.825
A personal invitation takes the guest to a
single shared project.

00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:09.023
The workspace shows the progress of their
own participation task.

00:00:10.582 --> 00:00:12.898
Open Harbor Lights Benefit Gala.

00:00:12.898 --> 00:00:16.206
The guest can read the request to confirm

00:00:16.206 --> 00:00:19.348
their arrival window and its current
status.

00:00:19.348 --> 00:00:21.664
The project coordinator manages changes.

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:26.077
Use the Workspace link to return to the
overview.

00:00:26.077 --> 00:00:29.441
Sign out when finished to close the guest
session.
